When the user right-clicks any selected text on a page or in a text
entry box anywhere on the web, Lojban plugins for the Firefox web
browser would attempt to parse the Lojban and get a gloss version, or
to offer Lojban suggestions for all non-Lojban words in the selected
text.

I would also wish for a fully integrated suite of Lojban learning web
apps. It would include the translation game, pixra game,
cmavo/gismu/lujvo lookup, a Flash game to play with grammar
constructions as a visual tinkertoy set, and spaced repetition flash
cards, with a system to display the user's progress in a curriculum.

-Eppcott


